{"overview":"ایزاکو تمام عمرش آرزو داشت قهرمان شود—هدف بزرگی برای هر کسی، اما برای کودکی بدون قدرت‌های خارق‌العاده، چالش‌برانگیزتر است. در دنیایی که هشتاد درصد جمعیت دارای نوعی «کویِرک» فوق‌العاده است، ایزاکو به‌دلیل اینکه کاملاً عادی به دنیا آمده، به‌دست‌نخورده بود. اما این او را از ثبت‌نام در یکی از معتبرترین آکادمی‌های قهرمان جهان منصرف نکرد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Izuku has dreamt of being a hero all his life—a lofty goal for anyone, but especially challenging for a kid with no superpowers. That’s right, in a world where eighty percent of the population has some kind of super-powered \"quirk,\" Izuku was unlucky enough to be born completely normal. But that’s not enough to stop him from enrolling in one of the world’s most prestigious hero academies.","tagline_en":"This is the story of how we all became the greatest heroes.","runtime":24,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":19,"y":2017,"poster":"/9oLPRgAYJJkx2IgeiW6CEqSHhXS.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":13,"y":2016,"poster":"/dmUuNVWAJumRkDNuauFaLSvga00.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":25,"y":2017,"poster":"/3HowZDbVmNsMliJC17W3wXfed4H.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":25,"y":2018,"poster":"/qoEaxE3SdU2QHzGVWWLJdy9z4P3.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":25,"y":2019,"poster":"/nD8ORLrJQAUapJPXCg0qicH4pLC.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":25,"y":2021,"poster":"/q4NQMhtjtYc2z2mzIb77SBd83sP.jpg"},{"n":6,"name":"فصل 6","ep":25,"y":2022,"poster":"/jd3miN11YtgoWH6sZQmLskEBuUd.jpg"},{"n":7,"name":"فصل 7","ep":21,"y":2024,"poster":"/GS8yE0MI4IqpRyJ6SMMKPzmU9T.jpg"},{"n":8,"name":"فصل 8","ep":11,"y":2025,"poster":"/fPT1PylBqQYFO3EMGm3tR8qYCsn.jpg"}],"episodes":170,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"دایکی یاماشیتا","role":"Izuku Midoriya (voice)","photo":"/rQNdJdZewk7VGP16ZNbpfJ9ZeMd.jpg","en":"Daiki Yamashita"}],"trailer":"TRr_dS2REo4","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/65930/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Netflix","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/rK1KljqmbvO9HQa1P